# ==============================================================================
# Deny by default.
#
# This repository is a PUBLIC GitHub profile. The blast radius of an accidental
# `git add -A` here is "the entire internet, permanently, and mirrored by
# scrapers within the hour." So the rule is inverted from a normal project:
# nothing is trackable unless it is named in the allowlist below.
#
# Adding a new kind of file is a deliberate act. Two edits, on purpose:
#   1. add the pattern to the ALLOWLIST section here
#   2. add it to ALLOWED_PATHS in scripts/guard.sh
# ==============================================================================

# Ignore everything...
*
# ...but still descend into directories, so allowlisted files inside them are
# reachable. Git will not look inside an ignored directory at all otherwise.
!*/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ALLOWLIST — the complete set of things that may exist in this repo
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!README.md
!LICENSE

!/.github/CODEOWNERS
!/.github/*.md
!/.github/denylist.example.txt
!/.github/workflows/*.yml

!/.githooks/pre-commit
!/scripts/*.sh
!/scripts/*.mjs

!/assets/*.svg
!/assets/*.png

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEVER — belt and braces.
#
# The allowlist above already excludes these. This section exists so that if
# someone later widens the allowlist (say, adds `!/config/*`), these still can
# not slip through on the back of it.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.ppk
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.crt
*.cer
*.der
id_rsa*
id_ecdsa*
id_ed25519*
*.kdbx
.netrc
.npmrc
.pypirc
credentials
credentials.*
*service-account*.json
*.tfvars
.terraform/
.aws/
.ssh/

# Local, untracked, and deliberately so: the denylist names the very terms it
# exists to protect. Committing it would publish them. See .github/denylist.example.txt
.githooks/denylist.local.txt

# Agent + editor local state
**/.claude/settings.local.json
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
